            "name": "True or False 2",
            "steam_appid": 581760,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581760/extras/9d3e3d3b8ef6df44a8091653ee462a91.avif?t=1705002375\" width=526 height=230 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full-fledged sequel to the popular quiz game True or False!</h2><br>Take a new quiz to test your knowledge and intuition - and learn more interesting facts along the way!<br><br>Your goal is simple: decide whether the statements are true or false. Some of them may seem pretty crazy, but they are true; while other &quot;facts&quot; are actually false. <br><br>What did the emus do to deserve armed combat? You will soon know the answer!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All-new surprising and entertaining facts,<br></li><li>Steam Trading Cards &amp; Achivements,<br></li><li>Calm and relaxing OST.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581760/extras/9d3e3d3b8ef6df44a8091653ee462a91.avif?t=1705002375\" width=526 height=230 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full-fledged sequel to the popular quiz game True or False!</h2><br>Take a new quiz to test your knowledge and intuition - and learn more interesting facts along the way!<br><br>Your goal is simple: decide whether the statements are true or false. Some of them may seem pretty crazy, but they are true; while other &quot;facts&quot; are actually false. <br><br>What did the emus do to deserve armed combat? You will soon know the answer!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All-new surprising and entertaining facts,<br></li><li>Steam Trading Cards &amp; Achivements,<br></li><li>Calm and relaxing OST.</li></ul>",
